:"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31771,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧虚席上得赵养民运使寄诗约今晚可归次韵迓之","author":"范成大","text":"偶携尊酒上孱颜，忽忆行人瘴雾间。\n便好来分苍石坐，已教不锁翠云关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31772,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙午人日立春屈指癸卯孟夏晦得疾恰千日矣戏书","author":"范成大","text":"百年能有几春光，只合都将付醉乡。\n衰病豁除千日外，尚馀三万五千场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31773,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丛台","author":"范成大","text":"凭高阅士剑如林，故国风流变古今。\n袨服云仍犹左衽，丛台休恨绿芜深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31774,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东门外观刈熟民间租米船相衔入门喜作二绝 其二","author":"范成大","text":"潮到灵桥绿绕船，海边力穑屡丰年。\n淡青山色深黄稻，恰似胥门九月天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31775,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东门外观刈熟民间租米船相衔入门喜作二绝 其一","author":"范成大","text":"菊莎杞棘爨无烟，日日文书横索钱。\n今日甬东官况好，东津门外看租船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":31776,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东坡祠堂","author":"范成大","text":"化原坊里尚黉堂，闻道苏仙有奉尝。\n想见当年行乐处，牙旗铁马照金章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provena